  "bodyHash": "f0dcea8554c37d35",
  "content": "<h1>额外的点缀</h1>\n<p><img alt=\"logo\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/logo_small.png\"></p>\n<p>各种小型视觉、音频和游戏性调整，旨在增强游戏体验。适用于 Minecraft 1.7.10。</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"hub\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/badges/github.png\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/an-extra-touch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"curse\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/badges/curse.png\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fan-extra-touch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/badges/modrinth.png\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcmod.cn%252fclass%252f26935.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"mcmodcn\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/badges/mcmodcn.png\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252f67.fentanylsolutions.org%252fmod%252fan-extra-touch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"67\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/badges/67.png\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.fentanylsolutions.org%252f%2523%252freleases%252forg%252ffentanylsolutions%252fanextratouch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"maven\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/badges/maven.png\"></a>\n<img alt=\"forge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/badges/forge.png\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"footsteps\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/gifs/footsteps.gif\"></p>\n<h3>功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>实体脚印。从现代版的 Dynamic Surroundings 移植而来。</li>\n<li>盔甲行走和穿戴音效。从现代版的 Dynamic Surroundings 移植而来。</li>\n<li>寒冷呼吸粒子效果。从现代版的 Dynamic Surroundings 移植而来。</li>\n<li>雨中行走时的水花溅射音效。从现代版的 Dynamic Surroundings 移植而来。</li>\n<li>环境瀑布音效。从现代版的 Dynamic Surroundings 移植而来。</li>\n<li>潮湿的实体掉落水粒子效果。从 Legendary Survival Overhaul 移植而来。</li>\n<li>实体、掉落物及箭矢入水时的水花效果。从 Particular 移植而来。</li>\n<li>瀑布级联泡沫粒子效果。从 Particular 移植而来。</li>\n<li>打开水下箱子时冒出的气泡。从 Particular 移植而来。</li>\n<li>雨水和水滴产生的水面涟漪。从 Particular 移植而来。</li>\n<li>吃蛋糕时的粒子效果和声音。从 Particular 移植而来。</li>\n<li>船只和实体的水下轨迹。移植自 Wakes。支持 Et Futurum 船只。</li>\n<li>带有破碎声效的海岸波浪。从 Coastal Waves 移植而来。</li>\n<li>在使用 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/kanmikan/cristalinewatermod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cristaline Water</a> 时，将生物群系的水颜色色调应用于原版雨、溅射、水滴和气泡粒子。支持 Forge 流体。</li>\n<li>草地踩踏。实体在反复走过草地时会踩踏草地。完全在服务器端运行，默认关闭，默认仅限玩家触发。</li>\n<li>Thermal Foundation 的 Blizz 雪轨，类似于雪傀儡。</li>\n<li>平滑 GUI 移植版。</li>\n<li>Minecraft-CameraOverhaul 移植版。</li>\n<li>配置系统，可为声音添加屏幕震动。</li>\n<li>部分功能从现代版的 Shoulder Surfing 移植（旨在与现代 <code>1.7.10</code> 版的 Shoulder Surfing 配合使用，但也可独立运行）：</li>\n<li>解耦摄像机</li>\n<li>持有特定物品或执行某些动作（如拉弓射击）时切换到第一人称视角，可配置</li>\n<li>如果摄像机距离过近，玩家模型会淡出</li>\n<li>全方位冲刺</li>\n<li>Shoulder Surfing 模式下的摄像机跟随延迟</li>\n<li>基于 Mixin 的加载进度条（绿色世界加载条）移植，感谢 @kotmatross28729</li>\n</ul>\n<p>整个模组高度可配置。</p>\n<p>此模组可安装在客户端、服务端或两者兼有。当模组安装在服务端时，盔甲行走音效会更加精准。</p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funimixins\" rel=\"nofollow\">UniMixins</a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unimixins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"curse\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/curse.png\"></a>  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funimixins%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/modrinth.png\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/LegacyModdingMC/UniMixins/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"git\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/git.png\"></a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgtnhlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GTNHLib</a>   <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gtnhlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"curse\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/curse.png\"></a>  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgtnhlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/modrinth.png\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/GTNHLib/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"git\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/git.png\"></a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fentlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">FentLib</a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fentlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"curse\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/curse.png\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffentlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/modrinth.png\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252f67.fentanylsolutions.org%252fmod%252ffentlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"67\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/67.png\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/JackOfNoneTrades/FentLib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"git\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/icons/git.png\"></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"breath\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/gifs/breath_pov.gif\">\n<img alt=\"buttons\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/gifs/drip.gif\">\n<img alt=\"footprints\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/screenshots/footprints.png\"></p>\n<h2>构建</h2>\n<p><code>./gradlew build</code>。</p>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/OreCruncher/DynamicSurroundingsFabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Surroundings</a>。盔甲音效素材和脚印纹理来自此模组。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Alex-Hashtag/LegendarySurvivalOverhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">LegendarySurvivalOverhaul</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Ezzenix/SmoothGui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Gui</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Mirsario/Minecraft-CameraOverhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft-CameraOverhaul</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Exopandora/shouldersurfing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shoulder Surfing</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Chailotl/particular\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particular</a>。级联、溅射、涟漪、箱子气泡和蛋糕粒子效果及纹理的来源。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Goby56/wakes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wakes</a>。水下轨迹效果的来源。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coastal-waves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coastal Waves</a> by Verph。海岸波浪效果、纹理和音效的来源。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Roadhog360/Et-Futurum-Requiem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Et Futurum Requiem</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/ExampleMod1.7.10\" rel=\"nofollow\">GT:NH buildscript</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p><code>LGPLv3</code>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/OreCruncher/DynamicSurroundingsFabric/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Surroundings 的素材和代码采用 MIT 许可证</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Alex-Hashtag/LegendarySurvivalOverhaul/blob/1.21.1/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legendary Survival Overhaul 的素材和代码采用 LGPL 2.1 许可证</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Ezzenix/SmoothGui/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Gui 的代码采用 CC0-1.0 许可证</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Mirsario/Minecraft-CameraOverhaul/blob/dev/LICENSE.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft-CameraOverhaul 的代码采用 GPL-3.0 许可证</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Exopandora/ShoulderSurfing/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shoulder Surfing 的代码采用 MIT 许可证</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Chailotl/particular/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particular 的素材和代码采用 LGPL-3.0 许可证</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Goby56/wakes/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wakes 的素材和代码采用 GPL-3.0 许可证</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coastal-waves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coastal Waves</a> 的素材和代码版权归 Verph 所有，采用 BSD 2-Clause 许可证。<code>Waves-1.21.x-1.6.1.jar</code> 元数据包含 BSD 2 许可证（<code>license = \"BSD 2\"</code>）。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/Roadhog360/Et-Futurum-Requiem/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Et Futurum Requiem 的代码采用 LGPL-3.0 许可证</a>。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/jbredwards/Loading-Progress-Bar/blob/1.7.10/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Progress Bar 的代码采用 MIT 许可证</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>请给我买些肌酸</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjackisasubtlejoke\" rel=\"nofollow\">ko-fi.com</a></li>\n<li>门罗币 (Monero): <code>893tQ56jWt7czBsqAGPq8J5BDnYVCg2tvKpvwTcMY1LS79iDabopdxoUzNLEZtRTH4ewAcKLJ4DM4V41fvrJGHgeKArxwmJ</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><img alt=\"license\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JackOfNoneTrades/AnExtraTouch/master/images/license_small.png\"></p>",
